  "description": "*“I never thought I’d be doing this for the first time with a filthy woman like you.”*\n\nWoo Hae-Rin appeared before Han Ji-Uk for the first time in five years, offering to get pregnant for money.\n\n *“Stay home tomorrow too. You’ll live at my place until you get pregnant.”\n“Th-that wasn't in the contract...”\n“Exactly. You think you can back out now?”*\n\nJi-Uk was relishing this moment. The contract, made solely out of the conviction that he needed a child, was taking a strange turn.\n\n *“If I'm losing out, I should at least get some enjoyment out of it, right?”*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Gyeyak Danpyeonseon (계약 단편선) Collection.*",
